; HYPOTHETICAL. THIS IS NOT L0 AS SPECIFIED.
;
; What limit 09 blocks. This is ordinary L0 syntax; what is hypothetical is
; the rule. Spec section 7.1 says a call in a prelude declaration resolves
; only to prelude functions, so if the runtime is linked as the prelude, the
; call to main below is "unknown function main". The smallest rule change
; would be: in the prelude, a call to main resolves to the program's main.
;
; That alone is not enough, because main's type varies by program (limit 04),
; so the runtime would also have to be generic over it. The design that
; needs neither change is for the compiler to emit this function itself, per
; program, calling the one writer that matches main's declared type.

(def l0_entry ((input (list int))) (list int)
  (main input))
